lto em mármore\n\n- Tomada para recarga de carros elétricos (1 por unidade)\n\n- Tomada USB nas áreas comuns e cabeceira das suítes\n\n- Infraestrutura para automação de iluminação, ar-condicionado, aspiração central e persianas\n\n- Fechadura biométrica e com senha na entrada de serviço\n\n\nCondomínio de altíssimo padrão, com bosque, área externa, piscina aquecida descoberta , academia, salão de festas, espaço gourmet, sala de reuniões, raia coberta e aquecida, playground, brinquedoteca, sala de massagem , sauna e academia.\nPortaria 24 horas com segurança.\n\n*Os valores anunciados podem sofrer alterações sem aviso prévio.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/098bf110-d18e-4488-ab9d-513522fae961.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/012bb18b-286e-4201-8ce5-083d55b408e1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/682c3491-927f-4f28-b6dc-f045df91566f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/49ee5256-3933-471c-a480-eb8b5cae5168.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/32e6fe02-efa2-46a4-9511-b6ee996b2236.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fb610ed8-dc0d-4467-9f24-b36a75b57986.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e7ed0952-b696-48ad-8c27-fb20ba1a2d04.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/36671c80-9ee1-401b-befa-14f9fe7a7fdb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a0758089e668f20d5e1193d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5827f8f7-0cae-4fcf-a954-3198c2302ab5.jpeg","https://blintz